            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant, <strong>PS2-inspired 3D action-platformer</strong>, a young Felko named Azzy sees his world flipped upside down by the sudden disappearance of his father and the emergence of an ancient, all-consuming Darkness. Thrust into a grand adventure, <strong>Azzy</strong> must channel the synergistic power of the elements through his trusty bionic arm, collecting upgrades and fighting to restore balance to the corrupted lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World, Master the Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>five distinct, sprawling elemental villages</strong> in your quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every location, you'll encounter new <strong>residents</strong> who uncover local lore, and consult with <strong>their resident Engineer</strong> who provides essential elemental upgrades. As you explore environments uniquely designed around their local element, you will unlock new parts of Azzy's arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Dark Crystals scattered throughout the world to unlock new powers and upgrade Azzy's bionic arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/ae714963383dd9cf3bef3e14e779b75e.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/ae714963383dd9cf3bef3e14e779b75e.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/ae714963383dd9cf3bef3e14e779b75e.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/53f0d0aef623c843911cc446fc46f043.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/53f0d0aef623c843911cc446fc46f043.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/53f0d0aef623c843911cc446fc46f043.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a large, unique cast of fully voiced characters, each with their own charm and backstory<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/f74114b0f9e5021ed3984b2f0c1aacfb.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/f74114b0f9e5021ed3984b2f0c1aacfb.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/f74114b0f9e5021ed3984b2f0c1aacfb.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront Unique Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey culminates in climactic battles against <strong>five powerful Elemental Bosses</strong>, each with unique skills and powers designed to halt your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the corrupted spreading roots of the <strong>Greeser Plant</strong> to the melodic chaos of <strong>Nergal the Entertainer</strong>, every fight requires a fundamentally different strategy utilizing your full arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant, <strong>PS2-inspired 3D action-platformer</strong>, a young Felko named Azzy sees his world flipped upside down by the sudden disappearance of his father and the emergence of an ancient, all-consuming Darkness. Thrust into a grand adventure, <strong>Azzy</strong> must channel the synergistic power of the elements through his trusty bionic arm, collecting upgrades and fighting to restore balance to the corrupted lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World, Master the Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>five distinct, sprawling elemental villages</strong> in your quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every location, you'll encounter new <strong>residents</strong> who uncover local lore, and consult with <strong>their resident Engineer</strong> who provides essential elemental upgrades. As you explore environments uniquely designed around their local element, you will unlock new parts of Azzy's arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Dark Crystals scattered throughout the world to unlock new powers and upgrade Azzy's bionic arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as