<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey culminates in climactic battles against <strong>five powerful Elemental Bosses</strong>, each with unique skills and powers designed to halt your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the corrupted spreading roots of the <strong>Greeser Plant</strong> to the melodic chaos of <strong>Nergal the Entertainer</strong>, every fight requires a fundamentally different strategy utilizing your full arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.poster.avif?t=1784701819\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.webm?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/b77abd8571934daba6cba3428f924301.mp4?t=1784701819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
